 openssh-server,
 ${misc:Depends}
Enhances:
 openssh-server
Suggests:
 lynis
Description: Hardened SSH daemon configuration based on Lynis audit rules.
 Applies security hardening parameters to OpenSSH via drop-in configuration
 snippet in /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/ and a fail2ban jail.
